    "text": {
     "en": "Our friends and neighbours are an important part of our life.\nBela plays chhupan-chhupai, or hide and seek, with her brothers and friends in the open space outside.\nNeighbours visit the garden to sit, talk, share jokes and laugh together.\nFriends help each other, share things and play together fairly.\nNeighbours live near our home. We greet them and help them when needed.\nGames like antakshari and snakes and ladders are fun to play with friends.\nBeing kind, polite and sharing make strong friendships."
    }
